The deterministic recognizer rules in pii/detect.go are ported from the
Rampart heuristic layer (https://github.com/nationaldesignstudio/rampart);
the Go WordPiece tokenizer, span merge policy, and premask design follow
the Rampart architecture. The NER model weights themselves are fetched
separately via pii/fetch_model.sh and are never committed to this repo.
